<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρα-ίζω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρητηρ-</span></b>  prob. in <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			57.24
		</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>):—in aor.
		
			Pass.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἠκρατηρίχ&lt;θ&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ημες</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drink out of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρατήρ</span>, i.e. <i>get drunk</i>, as
			we might say, <i>drink from the botile</i> instead of the glass,
				<i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				106
			</span></i> (prob.l., cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκρατηρίχθημεν:
				ἐμεθύσθημεν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>mix a bowl of wine</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρητηρίσα&lt;ντες κρητῆρα&gt;ς τέσσερας</span>
			prob. in <u>SIG</u>l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				274
			</span></i>; esp.for the orgies. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.259
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
